README.md
/scripts

#  Build output. gprbuild puts objects in obj/ and executables in bin/, both inside the course
#  directory because that is where a GNAT project wants them. Neither is course content, and the
#  course editor will otherwise list all of it in course-info.yaml's additional_files -- which
#  breaks Course Preview, since that reads every additional file and stops at the first one a
#  `rm -rf obj bin` has removed.
#
#  These two lines help and do not settle it. Before them, every commit for five chapters carried
#  the sweep; since them, none has. It has still come back in the working tree once, and an
#  attempt to reproduce that on purpose -- open the IDE, rebuild the whole course underneath it,
#  quit -- did not.
#
#  So what actually holds the line is check_additional_files in scripts/check_course.py, which
#  refuses to run while build output is in that list. `scripts/check_course.py --structure` is
#  the fast form of it, and is worth running in the second before a commit.
/obj
/bin
